  <sys:String x:Key="About.MachineAssisted">These translations are machine-assisted and may contain errors. Report them at https://github.com/mthomason/MAD/issues.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="About.Overview.P1">MAD Designer is open-source business intelligence software by Michael Thomason.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="About.Overview.P2">MAD is an open-source mobile business intelligence and report-design system. A .mad file stores a report's schema snapshot, query definition, and visual layout in one compact, portable document.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="About.Overview.P3">MAD Designer connects natively to MySQL / MariaDB, Microsoft SQL Server, and PostgreSQL databases, and uses SQLite for portable sample documents and local row caching.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="About.Overview.P4">On Windows, MAD Designer is a WPF application that drives the native Windows engine (mad.exe) over a JSON process boundary. PDF export is deferred on Windows and Linux; HTML, CSV, JSON, and plain-text export are available.</sys:String>
